    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha">
        <tei:p><tei:pb ed="1965" facs="https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n64.jpg" n="17"/><tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/28/9"/>Save Thy people and bless Thine inheritance, pasture them and bear them for ever. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_20"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/20">Our soul waits for the Lord, He is our help and our shield.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_21"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/21">For in Him will our heart rejoice, for in His holy Name do we trust.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:siddur:chol/shacharit/pesuqei_dezimrah/hoshiah_et_ammekha/psalms_33_22"/><tei:seg source="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/33/22">Let Thy grace, O Lord, be upon us just as we wait for Thee.</tei:seg> <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/85/8"/>Show us, O Lord, Thy grace, and give us Thy salvation. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/44/27"/>Arise to be our help and redeem us for the sake of Thy grace. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/81/11"/>I am the Lord your God, who has brought you up from the land of Egypt, open your mouth wide and I will fill it. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/144/15"/>Fortunate the people to whem the like of this happens, fortunate the people whose God is the Lord. <tei:milestone unit="verse" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:bible:psalms/13/6"/>And I trust in Thy grace, my heart revels in Thy salvation, I sing to the Lord for He has treated me well. </tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
